"Manon is a human Rabbit, about fifty, who does housekeeping at the LeafSong exams."
"She has worked the exams for twenty-three years and got many boater members their jobs."
"She wears the black Garments for Housekeeper from the Wardrobe."
"She brings Earth drinks each year and guards her dorm coffee pot."
"She pays for everyone's call home."
"She tried to talk Bti-qwol out of replacing Pineda with Alden Thorn."
"She reckons Alden's Wardrobe gear cost about 400,000 Argold."
